	solution: <<<SOLUTION
	risk: "xss",
### 修复建议

#### 1. 为敏感Cookie设置HttpOnly标志
```go
http.SetCookie(writer, &http.Cookie{
    Name:     "sessionID",
    Value:    sessionID,
    Path:     "/",
    Expires:  time.Now().Add(15 * time.Minute),
    HttpOnly: true, // 添加此设置
})
```

#### 2. 结合Secure标志（HTTPS环境）
```go
http.SetCookie(writer, &http.Cookie{
    Name:     "sessionID",
    Value:    sessionID,
    Path:     "/",
    Expires:  time.Now().Add(15 * time.Minute),
    HttpOnly: true,
    Secure:   true, // 仅HTTPS传输
})
```

#### 3. 实施内容安全策略(CSP)
通过设置HTTP头`Content-Security-Policy`缓解潜在的XSS攻击。
SOLUTION
